    {
      "label": "custom_content_change_must_differ",
      "comment": "TWO CUSTOM RECORDS IDENTICAL BUT FOR THEIR CONTENT. The node key's whole value rests on this: a record whose body moved must hash differently, or the diff reads it as unchanged and the edit never lands. The pair also pins that the ID is NOT hashed \u2014 the two ids differ and would collide the digests if it were, which would make every record of a custom graph look changed the moment its id space moved.",
